Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(停车场)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(工厂前方  行尸  天使)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:27.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这里是找你帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉占用了你的拖车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for taking over your trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我长大时身边有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew up ‭with a lot of people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家庭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big family?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是教养院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...group home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这跟那不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少没那么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the bad parts, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:38.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有史以来头一回  我有了归属感\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time, I feel like I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,努力确保你和萨沙融入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to make sure you and Sasha became a part of this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我也融入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}made me a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was first here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得接近别人很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always found it hard getting close to anyone --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邻居  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}neighbors, friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:06:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}boyfriends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有空该谈谈恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:10.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算不会持续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it doesn't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟铁匠聊聊多做几根长矛的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna talk to our blacksmith about making more spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们能和神之国交换防弹衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can trade with the Kingdom for some body armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  我们真正需要的是防暴装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, what we really need is riot gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:09.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天在找书看\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for something to read the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,子弹你可以留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you had a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:19.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙  别走  现在别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha, don't go -- not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔不是来这里训练人们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita didn't come here to train people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都要去杀尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're both going after Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没有别人的帮助  你们做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't do that without people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,许多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:42.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:45.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:47.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:50.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬知道罗西塔来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Maggie know Rosita's here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I-I-I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:06.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}About all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still -- I'm still getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  罗西塔要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the thing is, Rosita is going,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管有没有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}with or without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以应该有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it should be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那我也去  -我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then I'll go, too. - Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:22.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山顶寨必须为之后发生的事做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hilltop has to be ready for what happens after.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬需要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有了你们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家有了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道你不会  她也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know you won't and she won't,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我希望你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wish you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:01.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你本可能长寿  如果去了就不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it's a long life, and then it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:04.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要什么都可以拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take anything else you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:08.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你和罗西塔得和玛姬谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and Rosita need to talk to Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你欠她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe her that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得保护她  无论发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to protect her, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是这里的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the future of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:10:59.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是给孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我走后你能继续编\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can work on it while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.59,0:11:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:15.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 10 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会告诉玛姬发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tell Maggie what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在此期间  你想怎么做是你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you what you want to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我照你的吩咐做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing what you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:55.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:57.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:11:58.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得去找玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她在哪  - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? ‭  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们躲在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.35,0:12:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这通往另一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶在玛姬之前出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get out before Maggie does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来不及的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来引开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是去亚历山大的那批人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't the same ones who came to Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西蒙  你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon! Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也好啊  格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right back at you, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没料到你这么快就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't, uh, expecting you back so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想去我办公室谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk in my office?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:39.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人找到了一瓶琴酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a bottle of gin my people found.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢喝琴酒  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a gin man, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm a man of...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,口味经常变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}shifting specifics of tastes in transition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:48.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在喜欢龙舌兰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm into tequila now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:52.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陈酿  金黄色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Añejo. Reposado.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啜饮  混合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sipping, mixing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,口味的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Un mundo de sabor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琴酒像是松节油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gin seems like turpentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚喝了琴蕾鸡尾酒  口味就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened quick with a gimlet the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个非同寻常的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an unusual kind of creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:10.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尊重这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  龙舌兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心理笔记  记住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mental note. Locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要闲聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一次短暂的拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hopefully a quick visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能为你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这问题问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an excellent question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:29.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是啊  答案可就没那么好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, the answer's not so excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这里的某个人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a certain somebody that, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在要变成尼根的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}now needs to be Negan's certain somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你能为我做的就是指明他所在的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what you can do for me is point me in their direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你指的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get your pointy finger up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll tells ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:14:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:01.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:18.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个隧道是你挖的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you dig that tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.57,0:15:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬认为我们得有个出去的捷径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie thought we needed a quick way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就挖了一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们出来了  现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're out. So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:26.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如这辆能点着  我会抽走一些油\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this one starts, I'll siphon some gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要找到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got to find --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有个空水瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an empty water bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:15:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为这辆能点着  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought this was the one, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这车点不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:03.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪儿学的拆弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you learn to disarm bombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前是军队的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you in the Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:09.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识的一个人教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不是来玩"相互了解"的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm not here to play "Get to Know You,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要么谈任务  要么不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}so either we talk about the mission or we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣说有几栋建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus said there's some buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二三四层楼高\N{\fnArial\fs30}two, three, four stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在救世堂外面的东边\N{\fnArial\fs30}just outside the sanctuary to the east of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些建筑中至少有一栋能看到他们的后院\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least one of them should have a line of sight to the rear courtyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在行尸围栏后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}past the fence with the walkers on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们躲起来  等着  然后从那里狙击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hole up, we wait, we take a shot from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:50.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不得不靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we have to get closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外围有一些薄弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's some weak spots in the perimeter
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might still be able to take advantage of,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但假如可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是建议我们待在外面  做得干净些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we stay outside, do it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.83,0:18:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还能活着回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe make it out of there alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:13.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:15.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想确保我们杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make sure we get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就意味着我们得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们在远处射偏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we shoot from a distance and miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没有第二次机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't get another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会射偏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你射伤了他  他也死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you shoot and graze him, he doesn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会射偏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们进去被抓住了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go in and get caught --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会被抓住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:27.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被抓住就没第二次机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They take us, we don't get another try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们会杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.16,0:18:36.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们待在外面  还能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're out here, we're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get another go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没什么毛病  萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is wrong with me, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:18:58.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要确保杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make sure he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:01.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如这对你而言太过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if this is too much for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要退出  现在就可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to bail, now's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪里也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我已经受够谈论这个了  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I'm done talking about it. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你会考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你会重新想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll change your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该以什么代价达成目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what it takes to get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:27.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我这有鲜菜  -停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got fresh veggies. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用全称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the whole word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有蔬菜  他们让我拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have these vegetables they told me to bring over,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且  篮子很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the basket's pretty heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你可能不重  拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not you. Uh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:47.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装到卡车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load them in the truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你来菜园那边找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, if you meet me by the garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我可以把剩下的...  -停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can get you the rest... - ‭Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你以为我或我们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you think I am or who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:19:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己装车  我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load them yourself. I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:01.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-抱歉  很抱歉  -姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. I'm sorry. - Girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧捡起来  然后滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}pick that shit up right now and scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:10.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个我收了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我弄死你  姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me cut it off you, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.53,0:21:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈兰·卡森医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Harlan Carson, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:31.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要检查吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need a checkup?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:33.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧  好几年没查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably. It's been a few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不是为这个来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not here for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:40.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次你们来的时候  我们已经把\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already gave you as much medicine as we could spare
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-能交的药都交出来了  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the last time you were here. - ‭Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不是来要药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not here to take more of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:49.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你升职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're moving up in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:51.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根要你住过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan wants you where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:53.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个重要人物  哈兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an important fellow, Harlan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:02.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  这里有病人需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I -- I have patients here that need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根为什么要两个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does Negan need two doctors?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我的表情已经传达了信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think my look may have conveyed the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都说我的脸很传神\N{\fnArial\fs30}People say I have an expressive face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果不够传神  我来重复你的问题  \N{\fnArial\fs30}But if not, let me repeat your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要两个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we need two doctors?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答是  不需要两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:36.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥惹恼了什么人  所以被杀了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother pissed someone off, get himself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:38.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常残忍可怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very ugly stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:43.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}My condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:50.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的病历都是整理好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of my charts are in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.97,0:22:53.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得对这里的医疗方案做一些安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to make arrangements for some kind of medical care here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.61,0:22:55.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是我的长期病患\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially for my ongoing patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.54,0:22:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我得收拾行李  -不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to pack. - You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要的东西我们都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have everything you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.85,0:23:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有的我们也会弄来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what we don't, we'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢冰淇淋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you like ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:08.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有位女士会做小豆蔻冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a lady ‭that makes cardamom gelato.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.73,0:23:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit you not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.40,0:23:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点忘了  把那个放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Almost forgot. Set that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.87,0:23:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要公平合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, fair is fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,涉及到医疗方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving you high and dry
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.86,0:23:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不会让你们孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it comes to medical solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.23,0:23:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(阿司匹林)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.63,0:23:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西蒙  能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon, a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.37,0:23:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我已经证明了我能和尼根合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've proven that I can work with Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.66,0:23:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a can-do guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:02.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我需要我的人信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got to hang on to my peoples' trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.04,0:24:04.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然  你不知道谁会取代我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, you don't know who might take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人可能不怎么想合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, someone else might not be so cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.28,0:24:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能有很疯狂的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might have crazy ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:15.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会取代你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who might take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.72,0:24:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么疯狂的想法  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What crazy ideas? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在考虑最坏的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just considering worst-case scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.28,0:24:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, What I'm saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.66,0:24:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解人性  不难揣测\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know human nature, and it isn't inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.18,0:24:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你的担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是不知道  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not insensitive to it, ‭right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.81,0:24:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你担心那种问题...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're having problems of that nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}come to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.36,0:24:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道去哪里找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.21,0:24:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会安排的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll arrange it so that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要告诉守卫你是谁...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you just tell the guard who you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.42,0:25:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就会放你进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and he'll let you right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.13,0:25:10.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你别耍什么花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as ‭there's no shenanigans afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.84,0:25:13.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be none.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.03,0:25:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我只是想让你考虑一下  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just -- I just would like you to consider -- - Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.61,0:25:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会开几瓶龙舌兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll crack open some tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.76,0:25:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.09,0:25:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.72,0:25:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是一名优秀的生产者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good producer for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.85,0:25:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不想你压力太大  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want you to be so stressed. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.79,0:25:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能放了我的医生  我压力会小很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be a lot less stressed if you'd leave my doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.78,0:25:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.61,0:25:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.22,0:25:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再要求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.73,0:26:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算杀了那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭You were gonna kill that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.70,0:26:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会发现我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.35,0:26:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会  他也没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't, and he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:00.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserved to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.00,0:27:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来到这里以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since you got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没和我说过一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you haven't said a word to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.10,0:27:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能看着我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.56,0:27:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.41,0:27:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.35,0:27:46.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.80,0:27:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.54,0:27:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.62,0:27:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是这世上仅存的善与美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of the good things in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.18,0:27:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦一直是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Glenn thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:28:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定不会错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he would know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.81,0:28:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他也是这世上仅存的善与美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he was ‭one of the good things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.86,0:28:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想杀了那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to kill that guy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.26,0:28:16.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想把他们都绑起来  看着他们死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to string them all up and watch them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.29,0:28:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们必须要赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.63,0:28:34.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me win.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.62,0:29:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.41,0:30:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.28,0:31:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.60,0:32:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根还是没出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan still hasn't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.85,0:32:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过尤金在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Eugene's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.82,0:32:28.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.14,0:32:30.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.95,0:32:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎在指挥别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's ordering people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.06,0:32:36.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有他自己的打算吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing some angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.38,0:32:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能教教我怎么系这种绳结吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you teach me those knots?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道很多种  但没见过这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a bunch, but not those.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快  这些都不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't matter soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.43,0:32:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许重要呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.77,0:33:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.46,0:33:07.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here's the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.94,0:33:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样在你手里交叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross it over your hand like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.01,0:33:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把上面这一圈拉下来  折上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you take the top loop, bring it down, up,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.24,0:33:18.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从后面穿过来  然后这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and back through, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.23,0:33:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.34,0:33:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很幸运有你跟我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got lucky, having you with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.73,0:33:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to do everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.64,0:34:16.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.08,0:34:19.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我关于炸弹的知识都是他教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who taught me about bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.67,0:34:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个生存主义者  "有备族"什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survivalist, prepper-type shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于车的知识是马库斯教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus taught me about cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.80,0:34:28.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个技工\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a mechanic...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.64,0:34:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一心想做个特技车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a wannabe stunt driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.89,0:34:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混球一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.66,0:34:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绳结是猎人教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knot-tying was from Chaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.38,0:34:40.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  他真名不叫这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that wasn't his real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.97,0:34:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were others.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.40,0:34:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你去华盛顿的路上失去的那些伙伴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were those people you lost on the way to D.C.?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.35,0:34:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.59,0:34:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很多人想要保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of guys wanted to protect me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.55,0:34:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像我自己完全保护不了自己一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like there was no way i could know how to take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.08,0:34:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时确实保护不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.88,0:35:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hated the way that felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.64,0:35:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我顺着他们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I rolled with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.27,0:35:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们甚至都没有注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't even notice I was picking up
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.05,0:35:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他们的东西都学会了  还比他们做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything they knew how to do and doing it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.78,0:35:18.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比他们强了就离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'd outgrow them and bounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.05,0:35:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做爱只是觉得好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sex was just for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.17,0:35:28.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界都玩完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the world's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.99,0:35:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都该随心所欲些\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone should be getting their rocks off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.88,0:35:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他之间也只是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that how it was with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.73,0:35:43.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.65,0:35:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.43,0:35:54.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱上他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell in with him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.36,0:35:56.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他看到了我能保护好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he saw I could handle my shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.11,0:35:58.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前从不回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never looked back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.11,0:36:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我回头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.05,0:36:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们分手时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.34,0:36:16.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.39,0:36:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我最受不了的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the thing that killed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.73,0:36:29.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到亚历山大以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we got to Alexandria,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.14,0:36:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我表现得像完全没事一样  而他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was acting like I was all good 'cause he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.98,0:36:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  那个混蛋倒是真的完全没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, the son of a bitch was actually all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.24,0:36:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't figure this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.50,0:36:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里生活着  好像我们已经成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living there, feeling like we had made it,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.25,0:36:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是适应不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't pick that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.79,0:36:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  当他离开  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, when he bounced, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.04,0:36:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I thought I hated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也许我恨的只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe I just hated
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.81,0:37:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他先搞明白了自己的破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he figured out his shit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.89,0:37:12.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没和任何人说过这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never told anyone any of that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.44,0:37:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾是谁  我做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I was, what I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.71,0:37:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.08,0:37:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.74,0:37:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.87,0:37:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太蠢了  浪费了那么多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stupid to waste so much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我再也没有机会告诉亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'll never get to tell Abraham
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他快乐令我也感到快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy he was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.57,0:38:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时快乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.30,0:38:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.19,0:38:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他命不该绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.74,0:38:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕会想在抗争中死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham would've wanted to go out fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.26,0:38:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个拿球棒的混球连这个机会都不给\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that asshole with the bat took that away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.66,0:38:38.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死的要有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go out with a point to going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.45,0:38:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这是我们所有人都想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we all want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.11,0:38:59.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论最后变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how it all goes down,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.67,0:39:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的后盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.59,0:39:04.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是你的后盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've got yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.64,0:39:13.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那个混球出来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that prick's out there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.08,0:39:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.44,0:39:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.35,0:39:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡森医生  玛姬的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Carson, Maggie's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.06,0:39:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把他带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.75,0:39:55.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.49,0:40:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他离得太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.19,0:40:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我瞄不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I can't get a clean shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:14.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开对讲机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn on the walkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.98,0:40:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是尤金·伯特博士  首席工程师  \N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dr. Eugene Porter, Chief Engineer, speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.03,0:40:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还需要一打行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a dozen more walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.60,0:40:30.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按本地说法  也就是死尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}a.k.a. "dead ones" in the local parlance,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.50,0:40:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用来扩展围栏方案  立刻去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}for expanding the fence protocol PDQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.43,0:40:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻他妈去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, PFQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.50,0:40:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是尼根的要求  我也是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is per Negan, who I also am,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.85,0:40:41.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便抓它们要一晚上时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if it takes all night to procure them,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.07,0:40:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我需要派体格健全的人出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I need able-bodied persons out there
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.91,0:40:44.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在附近街区搜寻抓获\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the surrounding blocks of buildings
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.24,0:40:45.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立马出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}snoopin' and snatchin', stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.00,0:40:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根会在后宫歇息  不宜见客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan will be indisposed in the boudoir,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:50.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以在此期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.61,0:40:53.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切问题都直接向我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}any questions should be directed to yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.73,0:40:56.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金·伯特博士  首席工程师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Eugene Porter, Chief Engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.41,0:40:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又名尼根  也就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}also known as Negan, who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.85,0:41:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.77,0:41:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.26,0:41:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.07,0:41:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.14,0:41:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗莱迪说你找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddie said you wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.53,0:41:40.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.30,0:41:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现你最近搜索补给和招募新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed you've been slacking on your scavenging
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.16,0:41:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都很不用心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and recruiting lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.65,0:41:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你拖车里的人太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are too many people in your trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.26,0:41:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火灾隐患\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.74,0:42:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴林顿公馆还有很多空房可供客人居住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty of room here at Barrington House for our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.09,0:42:02.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.87,0:42:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给新人们安排了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have job assignments for the newcomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.57,0:42:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想留下来  就得分担工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna stay, they're gonna chip in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.39,0:42:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再想搭便车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more free rides on the teat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.58,0:42:12.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你任他们带走了卡森医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let them take Dr. Carson.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.53,0:42:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很惊讶你这次没下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprised you didn't kneel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.37,0:42:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么急着分开大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be really worried
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.59,0:42:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你一定很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're trying to split everyone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.91,0:42:22.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该用那种口气跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.07,0:42:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what might happen
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.29,0:42:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来的时候会发生什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all these Saviors coming around?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.56,0:42:28.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚是在威胁我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just threaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.58,0:42:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在讽刺  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was being sarcastic, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.75,0:42:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我觉得你刚是在威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think you just threatened me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.56,0:42:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.88,0:42:35.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what I'm saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.76,0:42:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会关照朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look out for my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.38,0:42:40.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我意识到  我们不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I realized... we're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.68,0:42:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.93,0:42:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好  龙舌兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, wonderful -- tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.01,0:42:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我打开  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crack that open for me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.37,0:42:52.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.15,0:42:54.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他出去  卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him out, will you, Kal?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.42,0:43:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没出什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.28,0:43:12.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙和罗西塔在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sasha and Rosita?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.84,0:43:19.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到那个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.57,0:43:22.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个半瓶子晃荡的安全措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a half-assed attempt at a safety protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.44,0:43:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要周密  全面的防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a full-assed, full-court press.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.23,0:43:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面的那些尖矛  铁链  头颅\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stuff out front with the spikes and the chains and the heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.88,0:43:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,视觉效果很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's good for the optics.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.94,0:43:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给潜在的入侵者释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sends a message to would-be intruders
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.56,0:43:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"别惹老子"的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the "Don't Mess with Texas" Variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.40,0:43:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要深入探讨一下真正的安全措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need to drill down on actual safety protocol,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.96,0:43:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是那些已被证明的薄弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially at points that have proven to be janky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.00,0:43:41.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.78,0:43:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才换我来值守\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm on guard duty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.12,0:43:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯前一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense to that last guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.11,0:43:47.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他连枪都拿不稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he could hardly handle a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来  你要出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. You're getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.80,0:43:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金  起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.41,0:43:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're breaking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.85,0:44:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.27,0:44:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.17,0:44:10.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不跟你们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.02,0:44:16.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没让你们来  所以走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask you to come, so go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.16,0:44:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People got to be en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.64,0:44:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懦弱  骗人的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That weak, lying sack of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.19,0:44:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.07,0:44:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.97,0:44:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.99,0:44:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这得花点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna take a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.67,0:44:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能有更多人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}More could be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.51,0:44:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.19,0:44:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another second.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.87,0:45:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.47,0:45:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你命不该绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.17,0:45:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须有所意义  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a point to it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.36,0:45:16.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.96,0:45:56.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.73,0:45:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
